  "details": "The ability to allow users to pick you up, either all the time or only while you're AFK.\n\nIt would need safety settings and a per user override like all other interaction features, and would need to be togglable per instance and by the world creator like Items and such are. \n\nI think it would be cool if there was an option to only allow player pickup if you were AFK, so your friends could carry you around or place you in a seat if you're going afk for a bit and you don't get left behind.",
